==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Wigglytuff|111}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Wigglytuff|89}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Hammer In''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Larvitar|87}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

